          "id": "usrPAGESHARE00000",
          "email": "anonymous+formpage@noreply.airtable.com",
          "name": "Anonymous"
        },
        "Experience": "Loved",
        "Comments": "It’s a little hard to rate this room because we were both jet lagged and sleep deprived, but no matter how you feel going in there is no debating that this is a top room experience.  There is a cohesive story with an almost endless number of rooms, straight forward puzzle work (that we maybe found more challenging due to our mental state), immersive set and impressive finale.  \n\nThis room was similar to Magnico in Laval, Canada, but instead of immersive, live theater with escape room elements, it was a straight up escape room.  My enjoyment of playing the room didn’t match the excellence of the room.  While the whole time I was very impressed and thought the scene and set were amazing, I wasn’t as engaged as would be expected.  I chalk it up to my tired and jet lagged self, but there is no way to know for sure.  No matter, I am very happy to have experienced the room.\n\nIf you live in or around Amsterdam or are in the area, I would 100% recommend checking out this room.  From start to finish it is a remarkable accomplishment.  \n"
      }
    },
